 "name_en": "Bill of Material Management (64F)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Bill of Material Management (64F)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Bill of Material Management provides the functionality to create and maintain BoMs single and multi level.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using change masters, different effectivities of BoM changes on component level can be defined, revisioned planned and released.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Where-Used capability allows BoM engineers to find all occurrences of a certain component across BoMs. In combination with a mass replace function, component replacements can easily be managed.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">BoM engineers can use BoM groupings to represent the modular structure of the product in a multilevel BOM, group component variants in variant BOMs, and group a BoM without creating additional materials.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Using preliminary BoM items, the BoM engineer can describe the custom engineered components in engineer-to-order and customer-to-order scenarios (such as in the tendering phase) without creating materials, and can create placeholders for later enhancement of business objects, such as documents or materials.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With Requirements Driven Development, requirements and block definition diagrams can be linked to product lifecycle management objects such as document info records, materials, and configurable BOMs.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Bill-of-Material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Change Bill-of-Material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Where-Used and mass replacement of components</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Replace preliminary items by real component</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Link BOMs to requirements and the block definition diagram</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Link the design document, configuration profile, or material to the block definition diagram</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__ul_aqq_4qq_gxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\"></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and maintain Bill of Materials in single and multi level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use change masters to define effectivities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use where-used function to find component occurrences with mass replacement across BoMs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use BoM item type as placeholder for later enhancement for business objects, like document or material</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Group BOM Items to model modularization</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use linked requirements to PLM objects to ensure consistency between defined requirements and changes during product development</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Plan for intended changes with the support of impact analysis on Requirements</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure the fulfillment of all requirements during the product-design process</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>物料清单管理 (64F)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">物料清单管理提供创建和维护单级和多级物料清单的功能。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用变更主数据，可以定义、修订计划和发布组件级别的物料清单变更的不同有效性。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用位置功能允许物料清单工程师查找物料清单中所有出现的特定组件。结合批量替换功能，可以轻松管理组件替换。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">物料清单工程师可以使用物料清单分组在多级物料清单中表示产品的模块化结构，在变式物料清单中对组件变式进行分组，并在不创建附加物料的情况下对物料清单进行分组。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用初步物料清单项目，物料清单工程师可以在不创建物料的情况下描述按订单设计和按订单客户场景（例如在招标阶段）中的自定义工程组件，并且可以创建占位符以便稍后增强业务对象，例如文档或物料。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过需求驱动开发，可以将需求和块定义图链接到产品生命周期管理对象，例如文档信息记录、物料和可配置物料清单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">更改物料清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用组件的调用和批量替换</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">用实际组件替换临时项目</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将物料清单链接到需求和块定义图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将设计文档、配置参数文件或物料链接到块定义图</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio10b3507ffda74ef5acb556424c593eb3__ul_aqq_4qq_gxb\">\n       <li class=\"li\"></li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在单级和多级中创建和维护物料清单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用变更主数据定义有效性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用调用功能查找组件出现情况（通过跨物料清单的批量替换）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用物料清单项目类型作为占位符，以便稍后增强业务对象，例如文档或物料</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">对物料清单项目进行分组以建模模块化</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将链接的需求用于 PLM 对象，以确保产品开发期间定义的需求和变更之间的一致性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在需求影响分析的支持下，制定预期变更计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保满足产品设计流程中的所有要求。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
